---
import Layout from "@layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy — Vanielle Lee"
  description="Privacy information for vanielle.io, its site analytics, and email newsletter."
>
  <main class="privacy-shell">
    <a class="back" href="/" data-astro-reload>← Back to vanielle.io</a>
    <p class="eyebrow">Plain-language privacy</p>
    <h1>Your inbox is not inventory.</h1>
    <p class="intro">
      Vanielle.io measures only what is useful for improving the site, and it
      keeps that separate from the email address you choose to share when you
      join the field notes.
    </p>

    <section>
      <h2>Email</h2>
      <p>
        If you subscribe, the site collects your email address, subscription
        time, and basic delivery information such as opens or bounces when the
        newsletter provider supplies it. This is used only to send the field
        notes, understand whether they are useful, and prevent abuse. Your
        address is not sold or rented.
      </p>
    </section>
    <section id="analytics">
      <h2>Site analytics</h2>
      <p>
        If you select “Allow analytics,” Google Analytics counts page views and
        records the referring site or campaign, approximate region, browser and
        device type, and clicks on important links such as the book, articles,
        social profiles, and advisory bookings. Newsletter form contents and
        email addresses are never sent to analytics.
      </p>
      <p>
        It also records visits to missing pages, failed newsletter requests, and
        limited technical-error categories so I can find site problems. Error
        messages, stack traces, query strings, and full asset URLs are not sent.
      </p>
      <p>
        Analytics stays off until you allow it. Advertising storage, advertising
        personalization, and Google Signals are disabled. You can change your
        choice at any time below.
      </p>
      <p class="analytics-choice" data-analytics-status>
        No analytics choice has been saved yet.
      </p>
      <button
        type="button"
        class="preference-button"
        data-analytics-preferences
      >
        Review analytics choices
      </button>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2>Service providers</h2>
      <p>
        The newsletter service processes subscriptions and deliveries on behalf
        of vanielle.io. After consent, Google Analytics processes site
        measurement data under
        <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">Google’s privacy policy</a
        >.
      </p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <p>
        Every newsletter includes an unsubscribe link. You can also ask for your
        subscription data to be removed by contacting Vanielle through the
        social links on the homepage.
      </p>
    </section>
    <p class="updated">Last updated: 31 August 2026</p>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  :global(body) {
    background: #f2eee4;
    color: #191915;
    font-family: "Instrument Sans", Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif;
  }
  .privacy-shell {
    width: min(740px, calc(100% - 2rem));
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 3rem 0 6rem;
  }
  .back {
    color: #cf2f21;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-underline-offset: 4px;
  }
  .eyebrow {
    margin: 5rem 0 1rem;
    color: #cf2f21;
    font-family: "IBM Plex Mono", monospace;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  h1 {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: "Bodoni Moda", Didot, Georgia, serif;
    font-size: clamp(3.5rem, 10vw, 6.3rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: -0.055em;
    line-height: 0.92;
  }
  .intro {
    margin: 2rem 0 4rem;
    color: #55586c;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  section {
    padding: 1.5rem 0;
    border-top: 1px solid #bcb4a6;
  }
  h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1rem;
  }
  section p {
    color: #5b5e71;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  section a {
    color: #cf2f21;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }
  .analytics-choice {
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    font-family: "IBM Plex Mono", monospace;
    font-size: 0.76rem;
  }
  .preference-button {
    min-height: 42px;
    border: 1px solid #cf2f21;
    padding: 0 0.9rem;
    background: transparent;
    color: #cf2f21;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-family: "IBM Plex Mono", monospace;
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .preference-button:hover {
    background: #cf2f21;
    color: #fff;
  }
  .updated {
    margin-top: 3rem;
    color: #7b7d8d;
    font-family: "IBM Plex Mono", monospace;
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
</style>
